  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:0",
      "text": "Morning. Halvorsen Freight asked to see the dashboard before they renew. They meet their board next week."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:1",
      "text": "Which parts do they care about?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:2",
      "text": "Late shipments by lane, and the carrier scorecard. Their ops director brought up the scorecard twice."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:3",
      "text": "The scorecard view is new. We only finished the scoring logic last sprint."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:4",
      "text": "The designs for it are done, though. The fleet map, the scorecard, the lane breakdown."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:5",
      "text": "Can we show it to them this week?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:6",
      "text": "Thursday works for me."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:7",
      "text": "Thursday's fine."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:8",
      "text": "Great. So Oskar demos the dashboard to Halvorsen on Thursday. I'll send the invite."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:9",
      "text": "Sure. Can you ask them for a sample of their shipment data? It's a better demo with their own lanes."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:10",
      "text": "I'll ask, but their IT is slow. Don't count on it."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:11",
      "text": "I'll tidy up the scorecard screens before then. A couple of labels are still placeholders."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:12",
      "text": "The colour scale on the lane chart is off too. Red means on time right now."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:13",
      "text": "Ha. I'll fix that as well."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:14",
      "text": "Should we mention the pricing change on the call?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:15",
      "text": "I'd leave pricing for the renewal call itself."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:16",
      "text": "Fair. I'll keep Thursday to the product."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:17",
      "text": "How long is the slot?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:18",
      "text": "Forty-five minutes, with fifteen for questions."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:19",
      "text": "OK. I'll do a dry run on Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-scope-dashboard-demo:seg:20",
      "text": "Perfect. Thanks, all."
    }
  ],
