    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that on Thursday 2026-11-05 Oskar will demo the working staging build on our sample data with no prototype screens and no Halvorsen data. The other remarks about the invite, shipment data, scorecard screens, lane chart colours, pricing and a dry run were stated but were not confirmed resolutions.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Mei, Oskar and Gabriel, with recheck passed, that on Thursday 2026-11-05 Oskar will demo the working staging build on our sample data with no prototype screens and no Halvorsen data.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that Oskar will demo the dashboard to Halvorsen on Thursday.\n- It was stated that someone will send the invite.\n- It was stated as a request to ask them for a sample of their shipment data.\n- It was stated that someone will ask but that their IT is slow.\n- It was stated that the demo is better with their own lanes.\n- It was stated that their IT is slow and not to count on it.\n- It was stated that someone will tidy up the scorecard screens before then.\n- It was stated that the colour scale on the lane chart is off.\n- It was stated that red currently means on time.\n- It was stated that someone will fix that as well.\n- It was stated that pricing should be left for the renewal call itself.\n- It was stated that Thursday will be kept to the product.\n- It was stated that someone will do a dry run on Wednesday."
